WEBVTT

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:03.980
You can't!

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.970
This ritual is a gathering called 
by the gods themselves.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:10.190
If you do that, there's no telling 
how you'll be punished!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.610
Well, it'll all work out.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.570
This is all right with you?

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:20.930
I see...

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.430
Good luck with the footrace 
tomorrow, Chu-tan.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.330
Yeah. Thanks...

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:28.910
Nya-tan.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.310
J-Just what I'd expect of the first

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.510
Eto-shin Selection Festival...

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.700
Yes. With 108 Eto-musume here,

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.400
it's certainly quite the crowd.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.690
Well, the twelve guardians 
who'll protect this country

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:56.260
are gonna be chosen from all these girls.

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:58.910
It's the birth of the first 
generation of Eto-shin.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.290
But why is it a footrace?

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:03.550
Very exciting!

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:06.420
I'm super confident in how fast I can run!

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:07.900
Hmm?

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.060
What is it?

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.880
I don't see Nya-tan, 
the cat clan's Eto-musume.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.340
You're right. She's not here.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.300
She seems like she'd be all 
excited to race, too...

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.790
Judging by her skill, 
Nya-tan is sure to place high.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.690
She's a top candidate to become 
an Eto-shin, along with Chu-tan.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:25.770
Yeah.

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.520
You know something, don't you?

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:32.210
I tricked her.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.030
What?

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.210
Nya-tan won't be coming.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.700
Why would you tell such a lie?

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:42.640
The first Eto-shin Selection 
Festival is about to start.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:10.690
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.230
<b>Episode 11:  Cat/Rat Shuffle</b>

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.560
Did you see that battle?!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:38.450
S-Something very bad happened!

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.440
What on Earth is going on?

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:45.110
Um, um... It was...

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:47.280
Mo-tan? Where are you, Mo-tan?

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.860
I'll try tracking Mo-tan's Sol/Lull.

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.690
Well?

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:01.000
It's no use. I can't sense her Sol/Lull.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.840
You don't mean... She was really...

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.320
...destroyed?

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.350
No way...

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.340
Hey...

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.560
Mo-tan will reincarnate, right?

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:11.690
Huh?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.520
Of course she will! Right?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.150
Just like Uri-tan! She'll be back tomorrow!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:15.780
Glance.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:17.790
Then the day after!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.540
Meow?

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.110
Okay, okay, the day after that?

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.720
Nah, maybe she'll make us wait a week?

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.170
Or maybe she'll wait a month!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.030
Meow?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.710
No. She won't.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:34.160
Chu-tan destroyed Mo-tan's Etotama.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:35.710
Her Etotama?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.780
Etotama is our source.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:42.050
<b>Ox</b>

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.620
One whose Etotama is destroyed...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.470
Most likely can't reincarnate.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.470
Then...

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:50.030
I'll never see Mo-tan again?

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.150
Moo!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.060
Mo-tan!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:07.110
Yes, my sweet honey.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.100
I saw you again right away!

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:14.090
Who was the meanie who said 
she couldn't reincarnate?

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.840
I'm sorry, Nya-tan.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:18.750
Meow?

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:20.920
Th-This is...

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.540
I made a mistake.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:27.050
Huh?

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.010
I got destroyed.

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:33.420
What? But you're here! 
You're right in front of me!

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.820
Even if you're see-through...

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.760
Residual Sol/Lull thoughts?

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.820
Nya-tan, you saw my battle 
with Chu-tan, didn't you?

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.390
Yeah, I saw it.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:47.240
Good.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.620
Then you understand, right?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.540
Chu-tan's special attack,

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.830
the secret technique Etotama Kagura Senguu,

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.440
is a dreadful technique.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.030
If you can't defeat that technique,

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:01.170
you'll never claim victory over Chu-tan.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.500
Th-That's right...

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.330
That's why, before I gave up,

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.640
I sent some of my own Sol/Lull into 
Chu-tan to stop her rampage.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:13.700
I don't know how long my exhausted Sol/Lull

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.850
can keep Chu-tan at bay,

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.370
but from here...

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:17.980
Meow?

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.730
As long as you have your love 
for Chu-tan, it'll be okay!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.240
Why should I?! I don't need 
any love for that jerk!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.590
Not everybody can tell,

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:32.420
but what's in here is a very 
deep, powerful emotion.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:36.620
I know love will open the 
path for you, Nya-tan.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.370
<b>Cat</b>

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.340
Now...

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.470
Goodbye, Nya-tan.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.260
Goodbye, Mo-tan...

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.190
She just fell asleep!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.450
What's going on?!

00:06:58.450 --> 00:06:59.950
I don't understand.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.050
Don't just fall asleep, idiot!

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.150
This is...

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.430
The repair of Nya-tan's

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:07.900
damaged Etotama has begun.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.580
Is it Mo-tan's power?

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:11.190
Most likely.

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:13.530
If Nya-tan's Etotama is repaired after being

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.410
damaged by Etotama Kagura Senguu...

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.660
That means her memories 
might return, if all goes well.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:23.750
Will having her memories back be useful?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.270
Nya-tan possesses a knack for fighting 
that even I willingly acknowledge.

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:31.140
If her memories return, she may be 
able to curb Chu-tan's rampage.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.760
You mean it? That's great!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.720
With the strongest Eto-shin back, 
all of this will be solved!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:36.640
Yep!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.680
You all...

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.650
You all want Nya-tan to go back 
to the way she was, right?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.020
If we had to say whether we do or not...

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:48.550
We do.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.010
Nya-tan was an Eto-musume we could

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:53.570
always count on when we needed her.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.840
It's just that she was 
a bit too carefree...

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:00.210
She always hated to be tied down.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:04.010
That's probably why the stupid 
cat always blew off everything

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.090
and took off on her own solo journeys.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.640
We did all we could to utilize 
Nya-tan's immense power

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:13.840
for the protection of this country...

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.760
But our efforts failed.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.040
I couldn't believe it when Chu-tan said 
she lied and stopped Nya-tan

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.070
from running in the footrace.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.990
Had Nya-tan become an Eto-shin,

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.240
it's unlikely she could have 
done the job properly.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:31.510
Which just means Chu-tan's 
judgment was correct.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.990
Well, yeah, but still...

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.730
The Nya-tan from before, huh?

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.750
Hey!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.250
I'm back!

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:46.420
Everything went perfectly again this time!

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.060
It did, huh?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.560
Nya-tan,

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:52.760
we're in the middle of an 
important Eto-shin meeting.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:56.400
Well, then! This will make the 
perfect snack for your meeting!

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.140
A souvenir! Here!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.110
Your souvenir is...

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.520
squirm                                 wriggle

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:03.170
An eel!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.000
How is this an eel?!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.940
That's the tail of the 
Eight-Branched Serpent!

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:07.690
Huh?

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:10.920
What are you doing?!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.110
Damn it, Nya-tan!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.190
Tee-hee!

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:16.680
Oh, dear...

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.550
Chu-tan, do something.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.630
For goodness' sake...

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.530
Whoopsie, whoopsie!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.880
Amazing!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.170
I expected no less.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.670
Ow...

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:39.730
Hey, Nya-tan! What do you think you're—

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.130
She's not here anymore.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:41.600
Tch

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.530
What the heck was that?

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.270
Beats me.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:47.480
Always so quick to run away...

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.560
She's calmed down.

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:06.710
Yes.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.280
I'm sorry, Chu-tan.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.210
I should have examined you sooner.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:15.000
You couldn't help it.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.970
We all made light of the 
changes she was undergoing.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.390
Is her condition critical?

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.100
For the moment,

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:26.560
Mo-tan's Sol/Lull is keeping it in check,

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:29.850
but Chu-tan's Sol/Lull is 
still out of control.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.420
What can we do?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.720
I don't know yet.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.660
But our only choice is to 
delay her Sol/Lull's rampage

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.960
while we find a way to treat her.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.660
Delay it?

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.150
If we can get

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.550
Sol/Lull from all of the 
others in the zodiac...

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.370
I understand.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.540
I want to...

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:56.240
Stop crying now, Chu-tan.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.340
B-But, Master...

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.670
As weak as I am, there's no way 
I can protect this country.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:08.350
Your best feature is your honest heart,

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.700
and that honest heart is also your weakness.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.800
Don't forget that.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.990
I want to save her.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.040
<b>[Etotama] An Eto-musume's core; 
a crystallization of the feelings and imaginations of humans. 
Provided her Etotama is intact, an Eto-musume may be reincarnated.</b>

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:35.000
<b>[Transferral of Sol/Lull] Eto-musume cannot create their own Sol/Lull. 
Eto-shin may transfer the Sol/Lull they receive through 
the devotion of humans among one another.</b>

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.260
What's wrong?

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.400
I-I'm sorry.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.040
I'm so powerless, I still can't believe I was

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:47.620
able to become an Eto-shin.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.070
That's not true.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:53.230
Your duty is to protect the 
health of humans, correct?

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.620
Can I really do that?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.140
You can.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:01.500
If everyone is healthy, 
the world will be at peace.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:12.600
Everyone!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:15.250
I have a favor to ask of you!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.500
A favor? What is it?

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.340
I just went to see Chu-tan...

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.510
Why'd ya do that?!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.350
Looking after everyone's 
health is part of my job.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:29.260
Of course I would examine Chu-tan.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.760
Yeah, but she destroyed Mo-tan!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:34.130
Ya know how bad that is, right?!

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.750
Bring 'er here right now!

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.190
I'll beat some sense into her!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:40.150
If you want to beat Chu-tan, 
then save her first.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.070
Huh?

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:44.290
Right now, Mo-tan's power is keeping

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.920
Chu-tan's rampaging Sol/Lull in check.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.870
We heard that from Mo-tan.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.800
But it's approaching its limit.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:54.440
It's only a matter of time before 
its efficacy wears off.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.020
That's why...

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:59.800
I want us all to give Chu-tan our Sol/Lull!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:09.850
<b>Rat</b>

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.700
I think Chu-tan's Etotama 
is currently turning all

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.990
the Sol/Lull it receives 
into negative energy.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:13.570
So, if we fill Chu-tan's Etotama 
with all of our Sol/Lull

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:17.280
before it has a chance to turn 
it into negative energy...

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:22.110
It might stop her rampage, 
like flipping a switch.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.460
So the only way is to suppress it by force?

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:29.290
This is the best idea I can 
come up with to handle it.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:33.200
Please, help Chu-tan.

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:35.910
She's fighting her own battle.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:40.190
No need to ask us that. Of course we'll go.

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:43.550
Mo-tan gave it her all, too.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.440
Chu-tan is suffering.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:48.590
We must do whatever we can.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.360
Yeah, fine.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:53.470
I'll have to hold off on beating 
Chu-tan until this is all over.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.710
Hey, Takeru, come with us!

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:58.600
Yeah! You've got great Sol/Lull!

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.540
I'll stay here,

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.860
next to Nya-tan.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.740
Nya-tan is the one I want 
to support right now.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.810
All of you should support Chu-tan.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:13.590
Like Dora-tan said, 
let's all do what we can.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.000
Takeru-san.

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:19.250
I think the thing I can do is right here.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:21.790
All right! Let's go!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.000
We'll catch Usa-tan and the 
other two on the way!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:24.960
Yeah!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.000
Is something wrong?

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.800
When Nya-tan wakes up,

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.930
<b>Sesame Oil</b>

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:29.930
give her this.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.900
Uh, right.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.110
It's best to drink at 43 degrees Celsius.

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:36.650
If she wants a different flavor, 
add some yuzu and pepper paste.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.690
Okay, I get it. Just go.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.350
Keep a close eye on her, okay?

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.490
Yeah, sure.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.300
Hey...

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.670
If your memories come back,

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:52.450
I wonder what'll happen to 
your memories of me.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.290
I'm sure I'd be sad if you woke up as

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.860
a Nya-tan I don't know.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:02.080
But my own sadness

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:05.320
wouldn't bother me nearly as 
much as if you never woke up.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.790
So come on and wake up, Nya-tan.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.040
People's prayers,

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.380
hopes, dreams...

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.620
They always look so beautiful.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:27.310
But there will always be just as much sorrow,

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:28.990
hatred, and loneliness.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.240
Chu-ta—

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.490
Chu-tan!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.570
I need your help with something!

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:40.570
Wait! Save your silly whining 
for after I give my report!

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:42.810
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.960
I've had some trouble come up, too!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.260
If you like, I can help—

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.290
No, it's okay.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.630
I'll hear them out.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:52.070
What's wrong?

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:56.070
Well, there's trouble in the 
region I'm protecting!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.020
It's probably nothing big.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:15:59.440
It is, too!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.010
Oh, shut up!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:03.270
U-Um, please listen to what 
I have to say, too...

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.270
How dare you tell me to shut up?!

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.270
I'm back!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:08.780
Nya-tan.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.100
What's going on? You look all gloomy.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.260
Not at all.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:20.700
I can't afford to be gloomy until 
this world is in perfect balance.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.830
True.

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:25.720
Is there still strife in the outside world?

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:26.940
Here and there.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.000
I see.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.670
Hey, Chu-tan!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.400
Oh, sorry.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.870
Yeah, we can all really rest easy with a

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.830
reliable leader like you, Chu-tan.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:38.960
I'm sure.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:42.880
You won't find many as dependable as me.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.270
Very impressive!

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.050
Listen, maybe now and then—

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:50.320
Hey, Inu and Piyo! How've you two been?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.900
Shut up, stupid cat!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.480
We don't have anything to say to you!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.860
Aww, don't say that! I brought a souvenir!

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.720
It's top-quality, all-natural conger eel!

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:02.710
Try it with some refreshing plums, 
and you can keep eating it forever!

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:06.000
Liar! There's no way this is a conger eel!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:07.320
Now, now, don't sweat the little details!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.340
squirm                                         wriggle

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.340
I knew it!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.340
Is this what conger eels look like?!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.970
That's the tail of the Chimera!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:13.670
Chimera?

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:17.970
You stupid cat! This time I'll really...

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.210
Get this thing off me!

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.060
Tee-hee!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.640
Terrifying...

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.420
Chu-tan, do something.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.570
For goodness' sake...

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.770
Amazing!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:36.070
That's our Chu-tan!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:42.200
Nya-tan, please don't scare 
everyone like that.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.890
Well, time to go.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:47.580
Already?

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:49.590
Keep it up!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:51.900
Nya-tan...

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.920
Okay, is everyone ready?

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.080
Let's begin.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.730
Made on Sol/Lull!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.580
How's this, Mei-tan?

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.330
This is fine. Keep it going.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.590
<i>That's it...</i>

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:37.990
<i>Chu-tan...</i>

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.630
<i>I'm in your way?</i>

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.830
<i>You don't need me?</i>

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.750
<i>You are now my...</i>

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:50.020
<i>enemy!</i>

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:00.910
What's happening?

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:04.160
I... can't move...

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:08.160
My strength... is leaving me...

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.250
Chu-tan's negative energy seems

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.630
to be swallowing our Sol/Lull!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.130
What?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:22.890
Is she trying to take every 
last bit of our Sol/Lull?

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:25.580
S-Stop...

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.890
No more...

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:39.280
<b>Rat</b>

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:34.570
<i>I...</i>

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:36.850
<i>I have...</i>

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.280
<i>I have no one!</i>

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.750
Did that excite you?

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:57.710
Grr

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.300
Sorry. I got carried away.

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:03.050
Wow! Takeru's Sol/Lull 
is all over the place!

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:09.180
Saury! Urchin! Gotcha!

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.180
You're the same old Nya-tan.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:10.310
Meow?

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.500
Nothing. How do you feel?

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.010
I'm not sure what happened...

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.040
But I remember everything!

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:23.130
I remember why I absolutely have 
to become part of the zodiac!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:25.500
Nya-tan...

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:26.940
Now then.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.140
Come with me, Takeru.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:36.410
Everyone's waiting.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.210
Sure.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.210
What in the world...

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.110
What happened here?

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:55.980
Master!

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.410
N-Nya-tan...

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:05.650
Incredible! Their clothes are back!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:07.430
Is this...

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:09.990
Are your memories...

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.040
I see.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:16.710
It seems there's no longer 
any reason to stop you.

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.700
Your Sol/Lull Seal!

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.520
Good for you, Nya-tan.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.010
Thanks, Master!

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:28.690
Now the only seal

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:30.600
you need is Chu-tan's.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.820
Yep, yep.

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:33.570
Your memories returned,

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.270
cat?

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:41.910
Chu-tan...

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.960
That night, you told me

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:48.910
that there was no telling 
how I'd be punished.

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:50.950
Maybe we're being

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.910
punished by the gods right now.

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:56.720
But I'll do something about it!

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.170
<b>Cat</b>

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.320
Etotama!

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:03.540
Sol/Lull Charge!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:46.320
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:40.080
I will destroy all who stand in my way!

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:43.070
I won't lose! It's for 
someone I care about!

00:23:43.070 --> 00:23:44.730
None can match me!

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:45.680
I...

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:48.460
Next time: Eto in Full Bloom.

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>Eto in Full Bloom</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Rat</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Watch again next week.</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Illustration: Ohara Sayaka</b>
